    "description": "This lot includes seven sealed VHS-C compact video cassette tapes for camcorders. It contains five Maxell TC-30 Premium High Grade HGX-Gold tapes, one JVC SX High Energy TC-20 SX tape, and one JVC EHG Hi-Fi TC-30 tape. The Maxell tapes come in gold and black boxes, while the JVC tapes have red/black and blue/gold packaging. All tapes measure approximately 3.75 x 2.25 inches. This item appears to be new and factory sealed in original shrink wrap.\nA Note About Untested Cameras:\nWe want to be transparent about what we know and what we don't. Unless otherwise stated above, cameras have not been tested, and any included batteries, chargers, or accessories are also untested. Since all of our merchandise is donated, the condition of these components is unknown, and we cannot assume they are functional. Rather than speculate about a camera's operation, we prefer to describe it as untested and let the photos speak for its visible condition. Please review the listing carefully and bid accordingly.",
